        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You and the Cloth have stopped being two things.</p><p><strong>All your Techniques gain one additional heightening step</strong>, as though you were 2 levels higher than you are.</p><p>Once per day you may cast a Technique of 2 actions or fewer <strong>without spending a Focus Point</strong>.</p><hr /><p>The extra step is automated as bonus damage dice on every Technique; the non-damage riders of a heightening step are applied by hand from the Technique's text.</p>"
